  "item_short_desc": "<p>Revamp your wardrobe with Rothco's Camo Tank Top, offering a fusion of style and comfort. Crafted from a blend of 60% cotton and 40% polyester, these tank tops ensure durability and breathability for all-day wear.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "31328",
  "description": "<p>Revamp your wardrobe with Rothco's Camo Tank Top, offering a fusion of style and comfort. Crafted from a blend of 60% cotton and 40% polyester, these tank tops ensure durability and breathability for all-day wear. Available in an array of captivating patterns, including Tiger Stripe, Desert Digital, and timeless Woodland Camo, effortlessly express your individuality. Perfect for casual outings or layering under jackets, these tank tops are versatile staples for any wardrobe. Upgrade your game with Rothco's Camo Tank Tops today. Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and active-duty personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
